{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>קדמו, תופפות</b> — either adjectives or verbs of the doubled-conjugation [מפעלי הכפל], and the peh receives a kamatz gadol because it is at the end of a verse; only מתופפות, from על לבביהן מעלומי העין [playing upon their breasts, the girls of the eye]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 68, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:13.203551983Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}